\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Disambiguation effect of the semantic enrichment. Each point is one of the 2\,415 pairs among the 70 enriched resources: six-field ambiguity (x) versus extended nine-dimension ambiguity (y). All 85 HIGH-tier pairs ($\geq $0.50, dark) drop below the diagonal, and drop most where original ambiguity was highest. Low-ambiguity pairs (light) mostly stay near the diagonal; a minority rise slightly. Overall, 2\,176 of the 2\,415 pairs move apart.}}{7}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:disambiguation}{{4}{7}{Disambiguation effect of the semantic enrichment. Each point is one of the 2\,415 pairs among the 70 enriched resources: six-field ambiguity (x) versus extended nine-dimension ambiguity (y). All 85 HIGH-tier pairs ($\geq $0.50, dark) drop below the diagonal, and drop most where original ambiguity was highest. Low-ambiguity pairs (light) mostly stay near the diagonal; a minority rise slightly. Overall, 2\,176 of the 2\,415 pairs move apart}{figure.caption.8}{}}
